# AGF Buffets

Merged buffet planning prototype with separate employee and guest/customer flows.

## Roles
- Employee: purchase prices, margins, stock, templates, ordering.
- Guest/customer: published buffet content and selling prices only.

## Features
- React + Vite
- Buffet templates
- Custom buffets
- Portion/package-size calculation
- Purchase and selling price calculation
- Aggregated purchasing cart
- Save edited buffet as template
- Demo state prepared for later API/PostgreSQL persistence
